    "chunk_text": "as mine word & \u00fea ne wyrc\u00f0 se by\u00fe gelic \u00feam dysigan men \u00fee getimbrode \u00dea rinde hit & \u00fe\u00e6r comun flod & bleowun windas & ahruron on \u00fe\u00e6t hus & \u00fe\u00e6t hus feoll & hys hryre \u00dea w\u00e6s geworden \u00fea se H\u00e6lend \u00feas word geendode, \u00fea wundrode \u00fe\u00e6t folc his lare. So\u00felice he l\u00e6rde swylce he anweald h\u00e6fde & na swa swa hyra boceras & sundorhalgan. So\u00felice \u00fea se H\u00e6lnd of \u00feam munte ny\u00feerastah, \u00fea fyligdon him mycle m\u00e6nio. \u00dea geneal\u00e6hte an hreofla to him & hine to him geea\u00f0medde & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Drihten, gyf \u00feu wylt \u00feu miht \u00d0a astrehte se H\u00e6lend hys hand & hrepode hyne & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic wylle beo gecl\u00e6nsod, & hys hreofla \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend to him, warna \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hyt n\u00e6negum men ne secge; Ac gang, \u00e6teowe \u00fee \u00feam So\u00felice \u00fea se H\u00e6lend ineode on Capharnaum, \u00fea geneal\u00e6hte hym an hundredes ealdor hyne biddende. & \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende, Drihten, min cnapa li\u00f0 on minum huse lama & mid yfle ge\u00f0read. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend to him, Ic cume & hyne geh\u00e6le. \u00d0a andswarode se hundredes ealdor & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, Drihten, ne eom ic wyr\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu ingange under So\u00f0lice ic eom man under anwealde gesett; & ic h\u00e6bbe \u00feegnas under me & ic cwe\u00f0e to \u00feysum, gang",
